---
title: Matcha Mint Cocktail
image: https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0515/2607/4549/files/63_480x480.png?v=1654035413
source: https://zentealeaf.com/blogs/recipes/matcha-cocktail
---

Muddle @mint leaves{1/4%cup} with @agave or honey{3/4%oz} and @lime juice{3/4%oz} with #mortar and pestle{}.

Add @water{1.5%cups}, @gin{2.5%oz}, and @matcha{1%tsp} to #cocktail shaker{} with muddled ingredients. Shake until well chilled and the matcha is dissolved.

Strain through a fine-mesh strainer, dividing between 2 ice-filled rocks glasses.